			"notes": "First real release.\n\nDifferences from squake/re:squake:\n- Removed trimping and sharking (too exploity)\n- Air acceleration is simulated at a tickrate of 100.\n- Added ledgegrab/glidestep.\n- Added experimental buffered jump mode, like in quake.\n- Locked down movement variables for less exploity movement on SMP servers.\n- Fixed bugs with ducked/eating movement.\n- Fixed a bug with getting more airaccel when strafing diagonally with two keys."
		},
